WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Picture a film of a traffic accident. Now listen to the question asked afterward.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
A single verb can make the collision sound more violent, even though the film has not changed.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A week later, some viewers report broken glass that was never shown.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
The experiment measures answers. It cannot read hidden memories or prove a meditation recording works.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying a twelve-minute audio, separate what is in the package from what the seller promises.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try the free baseline. Read the source. Decide whether you need to buy anything.
